# EmojiSlots: reopen latency. Panel centred x 750..1170, y 326..754.
ipc panels open emoji IRICE-TEST
wait 1
key -k Escape
wait 60
rec em-reopen 0.6 ipc emoji open
note After 60 s closed: the first frame with the panel comes within about 1 frame of the command and the spring starts at once (no warm-up hitch). Compare with QML, which is also instant within 5 min.
wait 1
ipc emoji close
# MANUAL: wait 6 minutes closed, reopen: both QML and Rust make the window again (a short wait is expected in both)
